    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4a8.svg"> 真正嘅興奮係自由 <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127807;"
    title="herb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f33f.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
